  ProjectName: Melides Pottery AR
  ClientName: Grandola
  Tags: 68
  Texts:
  - category: 0
    info: Lead Developer.
  - category: 1
    info: "Gr\xE2ndola Municipality (C\xE2mara Municipal de Gr\xE2ndola).\r\n\r\n"
  - category: 2
    info: "A marker-based AR app with animated scenes about the pottery process and
      Gr\xE2ndola's traditional culture.\r\n\r\n"
  - category: 3
    info: 'Keeping the AR content stable. When marker tracking flickered for a moment,
      models would disappear and pop back in, which broke the experience.

      

'
  - category: 9
    info: '- Added a tracking grace period: when a marker is lost, the model stays
      at its last known pose for 3 seconds before hiding.

      - This removed
      the flicker caused by brief tracking drops while still hiding content when
      the marker was really gone.'
